    "Orb form comes from concrete instance socket0; practice book also uses socket1 remaining practice and socket2 grade.",
    "Orb duration: skill 0=300s, 1..39=600s, 40=2100s; attack bonus=200%, 300% at 40.",
    "Orb mob level must be strictly below character level + max(0,20-floor(character level*3/10)).",
    "Book duration=10/15/20/25 seconds by mastery, not minutes; bonus duration is one second shorter.",
    "Book chance is clamped character level - mob level + 29 + skill level + grade; success decrements remaining practice only above zero.",
