    "The source power array has 40 explicit initializers, but lookup clamps to index40. That index is zero-filled. Balance approval remains a release gate.",
    "Blank/unknown forms were consumed by the old item-use function. Native plans reject without consumption; preserve/quarantine corrupt migration inputs.",
    "Generic loot grants cannot supply required bound form/book state; native catalog validation blocks them until typed grant support is integrated."
